d pathway genes in aflatoxin biosynthesis</article-title><source>Appl Environ Microbiol</source><year>2004</year><volume>70</volume><fpage>1253</fpage><lpage>1262</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15006741</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1128/AEM.70.3.1253-1262.2004</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Yabe</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Nakajima</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Enzyme reactions and genes in aflatoxin biosynthesis</article-title><source>Appl Microbiol Biotechnol</source><year>2004</year><volume>64</volume><fpage>745</fpage><lpage>755</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15022028</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00253-004-1566-x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chang</surname><given-names>P-K</given-names></name><name><surname>Cary</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Bhatnagar</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Cleveland</surname><given-names>TE</given-names></name><name><surname>Bennett</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Linz</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Woloshuk</surname><given-names>CP</given-names></name><name><surname>Payne</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cloning of the <italic>Aspergillus parasiticus </italic><italic>apa-2</italic> gene associated with the regulation of aflatoxin biosynthesis</article-title><source>Appl Environ Microbiol</source><year>1993</year><volume>59</volume><fpage>3273</fpage><lpage>3279</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8250554</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Payne</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name><name><